# transformers comes transitively (sentence-transformers / bert-score); 4.57.0 is yanked.
# NOTE (Dependabot #43, Trainer-class RCE, vuln <5.0.0rc3): the fix needs transformers>=5,
# but the pinned sentence-transformers==5.1.1 caps transformers<5.0.0 — clearing #43 also
# requires bumping sentence-transformers>=5.6.0 (which declares transformers<6.0.0). That is
# an unverifiable major bump to the core embedding stack (no CI; heavy ML deps), fixing a
# non-exploitable alert (simplemem never calls transformers.Trainer). Deferred to a
# deliberate, runtime-tested upgrade (run test_locomo10.py after). See sweep ledger.
transformers!=4.57.0

